"tutorial_ipucu_011" = "Use 1 one-bead and 1 five-bead.";
"tutorial4_108" = "Then write the tens digit in the 2nd column and tap the 'Check' button.";
"tutorial_ipucu_012" = "Use 3 one-beads and 1 five-bead.";
"tutorial4_109" = "And finally, write the ones digit in the rightmost column and tap the 'Check' button.";
