"tutorial24_1" = "In this lesson we'll solve problems without using the abacus.";
"tutorial24_2" = "Picture the abacus beads in your mind and solve the problems that way.";
"tutorial24_3" = "You can try imagining an abacus in front of you and moving the beads with your fingers.";
"tutorial24_4" = "But you should only solve the problems on the abacus.";
"tutorial24_5" = "So for 3+1, first put 3 on your imaginary abacus, then add 1 bead to it. Don't just say 4 from memory.";
"tutorial24_6" = "Now we'll go to the test.";
"tutorial24_7" = "In the test, numbers will appear on the board one after another.";
"tutorial24_8" = "You'll add these numbers in your head and write the result in the box below.";
"tutorial24_9" = "For example, these numbers might appear one after another.";
"tutorial24_14" = "The numbers will appear 3 seconds apart like this. When they stop, write the result in the box.";
"tutorial24_15" = "If you miss a number, tap the replay button to see the question from the start.";
"tutorial24_16" = "Good luck.";
